Z||000008||onfire||07-18-2001||03:20 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Coconut:<BR><B>Onfire...looks like I haven't been paying close enough attention. Last I rememeber, you were working on getting a Fiero, now I see that BEAUTIFUL BLACK MACHINE in your sig!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Man, that is one sweet lookin' car!<BR>When did you get it? How many miles on her and how do you like it so far?<BR>Glad to see that you've got the ride now.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>On the Cruise!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Coconut<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>85 GT auto.<BR>135,000 miles or so. Slight ticking sound from the exhaust. The wing is sagging a bit. So is the drivers door. Needs interior work. Sometime before xmas its getting bigger brakes and, 17 inch wheels. After xmas I am planning on getting a caddy 4.9 for it. Interior will be done here and there. Bodywork will be last.<P>Thanks for the comments.<p>[This message has been edited by onfire (edited 07-18-2001).]||||reg||1
